  "rawText": "# Use a self-join to build manager teams and report span of control, \n# average salary, high performers, and location coverage.\n# ____________________________________________________________\n\n# Option 1:\nReviewSummary is PerformanceReviews: \n    Employee.ManagerId ManagerId, \n    AVG(Rating) AverageTeamRating\n  Where ReviewYear = \u003C2025\u003E\n  \nEmployees: Id ManagerId,\n    Concat(FirstName, \u003C \u003E, LastName) Manager,\n    Department.Name Department,\n    CountDistinct(Members.Id) DirectReports,\n    CountDistinct(Members.LocationId) TeamLocations,\n    ROUND(AVG(Members.Salary), \u003C2\u003E) AverageTeamSalary,\n    ROUND(ReviewSummary.AverageTeamRating, \u003C2\u003E) AverageTeamRating,\n    ROUND(SUM(Members.Salary), \u003C2\u003E) TeamPayroll\n  Where Members.Id IS NOT NULL\n  Order DirectReports ASC, TeamPayroll ASC\n  Left Join ReviewSummary On Id = ReviewSummary.ManagerId\n\n# Option 2:\nManager is Employees:\n    FirstName \u002B \u003C \u003E \u002B LastName\n    ",
